OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 10 APR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GMark Forrest introduces specially
OL,11,     Grecorded performances from Perth
OL,12,     Gof chamber music evoking the
OL,13,     Gnight and concludes his plainsong-
OL,14,     Ginspired theme with a symphony by
OL,15,     GRachmaninov.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod explores the
OL,18,     Gorigins and evolution of George
OL,19,     GGershwin's opera Porgy and Bess.
