OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 10 APR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Healing Musicians
OL,5,     GKate Kennedy hears from young
OL,6,     Gmusicians Rebecca Toal and Hattie
OL,7,     GButterworth how mental health
OL,8,     Gissues forced them to rethink
OL,9,     Gtheir relationship with their
OL,10,     Ginstruments.
OL,11,G2200FLate Junction
OL,12,     GJoin Verity Sharp as she takes a
OL,13,     Gspin around the world of
OL,14,     Gexperimental listening, from the
OL,15,     Gbellows of church organs to the
OL,16,     Gexistential questioning of a
OL,17,     Gvirtual assistant.
